    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip Rally is an adrenaline-fueled racing game blending high-speed action with a unique flipping mechanic. Master perfectly timed flips to earn powerful boosts and race through diverse, vibrant environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against the clock on challenging tracks filled with ramps, jumps, and thrilling obstacles. Execute flips flawlessly to maximize speed and set unbeatable records. Customize your vehicle with numerous visual styles and performance options to match your unique racing personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple exciting game modes and a wide range of vehicles and environments, Flip Rally promises endless hours of flipping fun and racing thrills. Are you ready to flip your way to victory and dominate the leaderboards?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip Rally is an adrenaline-fueled racing game blending high-speed action with a unique flipping mechanic. Master perfectly timed flips to earn powerful boosts and race through diverse, vibrant environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against the clock on challenging tracks filled with ramps, jumps, and thrilling obstacles. Execute flips flawlessly to maximize speed and set unbeatable records. Customize your vehicle with numerous visual styles and performance options to match your unique racing personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple exciting game modes and a wide range of vehicles and environments, Flip Rally promises endless hours of flipping fun and racing thrills. Are you ready to flip your way to victory and dominate the leaderboards?</p>",
    "short_description": "Flip Rally combines thrilling racing with a unique flip mechanic, nail perfect flips for powerful boosts! Race through vibrant tracks, customize your car, and beat the clock in intense, adrenaline-packed action. Flip your way to victory!",
